  ".................ggGGhhKKHHHKKKKKKKKhhhh................",
  "..................gghhhhKHHHKKKKKKKhhhh.................",
  "...................hhhhhhHHHKKKKKKhhhhS.................",
  "..................ShhhhhhHHHKKKKKhhhhhSSSSS.............",
  ".................SSSShhhhHHHhKhhhhhhSSSSSSS.............",
  "...............gHBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBSSS............",
  "...............GBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBSSSS...........",
